The code snippet does not contain the specific solution behavior mentioned in the vulnerability knowledge. It processes the rules and then clears the chain, which could lead to a use-after-free scenario if an error occurs during rule processing. The correct solution would involve restructuring the code to ensure that the chain is not cleared until all operations on its rules are complete and safe.

